connection.  I usually answer that the word extropy partly means increasing
order, and this sense is opposite to entropy, and partly it means expansion
and growth.  I also say that there is only so much sense you can put into
the etymology of one word, and that there is a lot more to the extropiansm
and development of the world in general - and suggest people to read books.

   This seems to lead people's attention from labels to meaning/issues.

